  "question": {
    "text": "The system of equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;has no solution if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
